                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9d13c3fb-0451-3b9d-be4f-bef99bb4975c",
                        "entry_id": "f5f9ef4f-980d-325f-bcdc-30504cc87e34",
                        "glosses": [
                            "economist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0515c85-961e-4238-88f5-7831210496f1",
                                "sense_id": "9d13c3fb-0451-3b9d-be4f-bef99bb4975c",
                                "text": "Брани́л Гоме́ра, Феокри́та;\nЗато́ чита́л Адама Сми́та\nИ был глубо́кий эконо́м,\nТо есть уме́л суди́ть о том,\nКак госуда́рство богате́ет,\nИ чем живёт, и почему́\nНе ну́жно зо́лота ему́,\nКогда́ просто́й проду́кт име́ет.",
                                "translation": "Homer, Theocritus he rubbished,\nBut Adam Smith instead he relished,\nAnd was a great economist.\nThat is, he knew how states subsist,\nAcquire their wealth, and what they live on\nAnd why they can dispense with gold,\nWhen, in the land itself they hold\nThe simple product ready given.",
                                "english": "Homer, Theocritus he rubbished,\nBut Adam Smith instead he relished,\nAnd was a great economist.\nThat is, he knew how states subsist,\nAcquire their wealth, and what they live on\nAnd why they can dispense with gold,\nWhen, in the land itself they hold\nThe simple product ready given."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "60b9165f-76cb-32b9-938e-1955c9322e27",
                        "entry_id": "f5f9ef4f-980d-325f-bcdc-30504cc87e34",
                        "glosses": [
                            "steward (one who administers affairs)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6eae2009-665d-4873-92e3-64b366a357fa",
                                "sense_id": "60b9165f-76cb-32b9-938e-1955c9322e27",
                                "text": "По́вар и эконо́м клу́ба с весёлыми ли́цами слу́шали приказа́ния гра́фа, потому́ что они́ зна́ли, что ни при ком, как при нём, нельзя́ бы́ло лу́чше поживи́ться на обе́де, кото́рый сто́ил не́сколько ты́сяч.",
                                "translation": "The club cook and the steward listened to the count's orders with pleased faces, for they knew that under no other management could they so easily extract a good profit for themselves from a dinner costing several thousand rubles.",
                                "english": "The club cook and the steward listened to the count's orders with pleased faces, for they knew that under no other management could they so easily extract a good profit for themselves from a dinner costing several thousand rubles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
